# E-Commerce Logistics & Delivery Performance Analysis

**Author:** Marziyeh Eslamparasti | Business Analyst | Hamburg  
**Dataset:** [Olist Brazilian E-Commerce](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/olistbr/brazilian-ecommerce) — 96,470 real delivered orders (2016–2018)  
**Tools:** Python · Pandas · DuckDB · Matplotlib · Scikit-learn

